        <terms:contributor xml:lang="en">Hele-Mai Haav</terms:contributor>
        <terms:contributor xml:lang="en">Jens Niederhausen</terms:contributor>
        <terms:contributor xml:lang="en">Marc-Andree Wolf</terms:contributor>
        <terms:contributor xml:lang="en">Theodor Chirvasuta</terms:contributor>
        <terms:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-02-27</terms:created>
        <terms:creator xml:lang="en">Riina Maigre</terms:creator>
        <terms:creator xml:lang="en">Tarmo Robal</terms:creator>
        <terms:description xml:lang="en">
        The CORE is the integration ontology that imports all the specific ontology modules and the connector (bridge) ontology of these.
